  isSonnet5 returns true for claude-sonnet-5[1m]
  isSonnet5 returns false for sonnet-4-6 / claude-sonnet-4-6
  isSonnet5 returns false for opus / haiku / fable / null

=== 5. Effort Levels and Max Output Tokens ===
  supportsEffortLevel returns true for sonnet (Sonnet 5)
  supportsXHighEffortLevel returns true for sonnet (Sonnet 5)
  supportsXHighEffortLevel returns false for Sonnet 4.6 (unchanged)
  supportsMaxEffortLevel returns true for sonnet (Sonnet 5)
  getMaxOutputTokensForModel returns 128K for sonnet (Sonnet 5)
  getMaxOutputTokensForModel returns default (64K) for Sonnet 4.6 (unchanged)

=== 6. Adaptive-Thinking-Only Environment Handling ===
  getClaudeEnv does NOT set MAX_THINKING_TOKENS for sonnet (adaptive-only)
  getClaudeEnv does NOT set MAX_THINKING_TOKENS for claude-sonnet-5
  getClaudeEnv sets CLAUDE_CODE_EFFORT_LEVEL=xhigh for sonnet with xhigh think
  getClaudeEnv sets CLAUDE_CODE_EFFORT_LEVEL=max for sonnet with max think
  sonnet + --think off: no MAX_THINKING_TOKENS
  sonnet + --think off: lowest effort
  sonnet + --think low: no MAX_THINKING_TOKENS
  sonnet + --think low: effort=low
  sonnet + --think medium: no MAX_THINKING_TOKENS
  sonnet + --think medium: effort=medium
  sonnet + --think high: no MAX_THINKING_TOKENS
  sonnet + --think high: effort=high
  sonnet + --think xhigh: no MAX_THINKING_TOKENS
  sonnet + --think xhigh: effort=xhigh
  sonnet + --think max: no MAX_THINKING_TOKENS
  sonnet + --think max: effort=max

=== 7. Default Fallback and Escalate Tier ===
  claude-sonnet-5 falls back to sonnet-4-6
  sonnet alias falls back to sonnet-4-6 (resolves to Sonnet 5 first)
  canonicalTier maps sonnet-5 and claude-sonnet-5 to sonnet tier

=== 8. Availability and Backward Compatibility ===
  getAvailableModelNames includes sonnet and sonnet-5 for claude
  primaryModelNames.claude still advertises sonnet
  sonnet-4-6 alias still maps to claude-sonnet-4-6 (backward compat)
  claude-sonnet-4-6 full ID still works (backward compat)
  sonnet-4-5 alias still maps to claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929 (backward compat)

